{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"tree_pine","model_identifier":"tree_pine","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# tree_pine\n\nReference pine: straight pale-brown trunk, high crown of dark layered tiers, about 10 m (356 u).\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -50..46, y 0..359, z -41..45 units (2.70 x 10.10 x 2.43 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 256 x 1024, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering; every visible face has its own region painted with its material at world position (identical faces share one). No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: 19.\n\n## Hit box\n\n- trunk: 14 x 356 x 14 at the origin (the solid, blocking part)\n- canopy: see bounds; units walk under it\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `rustle` | 5.0 | loop | canopy bones sway very slightly (trunk still) |\n| `hit` | 0.4 | once | canopy shivers after an axe strike |\n| `fall` | 2.5 | once | whole `tree` group tips over sideways onto +X about the trunk base edge, hits at 1.5 s, bounces once, settles by 2.1 s; canopy whips on impact |\n\n## Notes\n\n- `rustle` and `hit` move only the canopy groups; `fall` rotates the `tree` group (pivot on the trunk base edge on +X), so the trunk lies along +X after 1.5 s (it stops short of flat where the crown meets the ground). Swap to the `_stump` model (and spawn the `_log_pile`) once it has settled.\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":1024},"elements":[{"name":"trunk","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-7.0,0.0,-7.0],"to":[7.0,335.5556,7.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[7.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,0.4444,14.0,336.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[0.0,0.4444,14.0,336.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,0.4444,14.0,336.0],